        "id": 20176,
        "name": "",
        "username": "fjur",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-08-17T16:32:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Branch &amp; Claw Major Power Card&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sick.oberien.de/?query=Pent-Up%20Calamity\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Pent-Up Calamity</a>&nbsp;lists all four types of tokens that were released when it was, but,&nbsp;understandably, not Badlands (because they were released later as part of Jagged Earth). Said Power Card appears to be the only Game component that references all the tokens*, so why should Badlands be excluded?&nbsp;I petition/request/suggest/beg&nbsp;that this should be dealt with. If reprinting the Card is not something that will happen, could we at least get an official ruling amending Badlands to that list. I suppose there could be some thematic reason why Badlands are excluded, but I cannot think of any.</p>\n<p>*If there are any others I am missing, I would appreciate someone pointing them out and for them to receive the same treatment.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:10.544Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
